      "created_at": "2018-08-07T19:17:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For the folks at GTG or anyone else who got the case,&nbsp;</p><p>Is the front panel suppose to open all the way and lay flush with the top?&nbsp; &nbsp;I thought that was the case but mine doesn't.&nbsp; It just seems to hang at an angle and there seems to be a lot of pressure on it.&nbsp; I even seem to have a tiny tear from letting it fold to far open.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
